  "description": "Find the minimum number of positive deci-binary numbers needed to sum up to a given string n.",
  "target": "32",
  "pseudocode": "function minPartitions(n) {\n  let maxDigit = 0;\n  for (let i = 0; i < n.length; i++) {\n    maxDigit = Math.max(maxDigit, parseInt(n[i]));\n  }\n  return maxDigit;\n}",
